### TezYol API Tests
### VS Code extension: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) o'rnating

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@phone = +998901234567
@adminPhone = +998900000000

### ─── 1. AUTH ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### OTP so'rash (log'da kodni ko'rasiz)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}"
}

###

### OTP tasdiqlash → TOKEN olish (kodni log'dan ko'chiring)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "code": "1234",
  "role": "PASSENGER"
}

###

### Token saqlash (yuqoridagi response'dan ko'chiring)
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ─── 2. PASSENGER ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Tariflar ro'yxati
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passenger/tariffs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Narx hisoblash (surge bilan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passenger/trips/estimate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tariffId": 1,
  "distanceKm": 5.0,
  "lat": 41.2995,
  "lon": 69.2401
}

###

### Demand indikatori (surge darajasi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passenger/demand?lat=41.2995&lon=69.2401
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Yaqin haydovchilar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passenger/nearby-drivers?lat=41.2995&lon=69.2401
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Buyurtma berish
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passenger/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tariffId": 1,
  "fromAddress": "Chilonzor, Toshkent",
  "toAddress": "Yunusobod, Toshkent",
  "fromLat": 41.2995,
  "fromLon": 69.2401,
  "toLat": 41.3400,
  "toLon": 69.2900,
  "distance": 5200
}

###

### Faol trip
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passenger/trips/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Trip tarixi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passenger/trips?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Statistika
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passenger/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── 3. ADMIN ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Admin OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{adminPhone}}"
}

###

### Admin login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{adminPhone}}",
  "code": "1234",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Barcha triplar (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/trips?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Statistika (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Tariflar boshqaruvi (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tariffs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ─── 4. DRIVER ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@driverPhone = +998911234567
@driverToken = PASTE_DRIVER_TOKEN_HERE

### Haydovchi profili
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/driver/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

###

### Online/Offline toggle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/driver/toggle-online
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

###

### Lokatsiya yangilash
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/driver/location
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lat": 41.2995,
  "lon": 69.2401
}

###

### Kelayotgan trip'larni ko'rish
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/driver/trips/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
